```mdl
feat F-16: Compliance review annotations
  uses: [org.dxos.spec.review, SpecArticle]
  desc: |
    The `spec-review` skill writes `<SPEC>.review.mdl` beside a spec: one verdict
    per item, in the review dialect (`org.dxos.spec.review`).

  req F-16.1: SpecArticle reads a spec's reviews: a spec in a space reads its SpecReviews from
              ECHO; a spec read from a checkout reads the review beside it there and re-reads it
              every 3 seconds.
  req F-16.2: Each reviewed item's declaration line gets a status bar and chip in
              the margin; a chip opens the verdict in the Review view.
  req F-16.3: Each definitions-graph box gets a status badge; a feature shows the
              worst status of its requirements.
  req F-16.4: The Review view lists verdicts worst first as cards in a list: each
