             it draws any block a dialect defines (org.dxos.plugin.projects#F-4.14).
  req F-20.2: `/feat` writes a new `feat` block in place (org.dxos.plugin.projects#F-4.10).
  req F-20.3: A `feat` block's `depends:` names the features it depends on by key or label, and its `spec:` cites the spec that
             breaks it down by object id (`echo:///<id>`) or spec id.
  req F-20.4: SpecArticle draws a spec's blocks as forms too, and its view menu switches to Plain text and back. Diff
             mode draws the text. In a project's Specs tab its editor tools are in the project's toolbar
             (org.dxos.plugin.projects#F-4.7), and it draws no toolbar of its own.
```

