```mdl
decision D-40: A pull offers the file to every codec, not only to one that wrote the document, so a document read before it was a spec's becomes one. op:importSpecFile and op:exportSpecFile go through the codecs too, merging a remote change in the file's form and keeping the file text last synced, in memory and in local storage, as the base of the next push; with no base known, the export fails, so nothing is pushed until the next pull of the file. Fills in [D-39].
