```mdl
decision D-46: The sync maps front matter in plugin-code's `FrontMatter`, around the codecs: a pull sets the spec's name and meta from the file and passes on what follows, and a push writes the front matter back against the last synced file, rewriting only the keys it has. A new file gets every key the spec has, and a spec whose text starts with front matter keeps the file as it is. ImportSpecFile and ExportSpecFile map it the same way. Fills in [D-45].
