```mdl
decision D-85: Definitions opens on the spec's sections, a card each; a section lists its definitions; a definition lists what uses it and what it uses, each tagged with the linking field. No level draws arrows, and each card counts its references by section. Decisions draws threads in place of the graph: the decisions that build on, supersede or approve one another, newest first, folded to the newest, opened on a rail of lanes, with superseded decisions hidden until asked for. Questions stay in decisions by person. Fills in [D-83].
