```mdl
decision D-125: Each sync pass fills the fields a spec has unset from its file before comparing them, whether or not the file changed; a pull also takes what the file changed since the last sync. Fills in [D-119] and [D-121].
  date: 2026-11-13
  by: agent:claude-code
