```

```mdl
decision D-129: The fill runs on every path that compares a spec with its file: each local sync pass, each GitHub export, and a spec whose text still holds front matter. Fills in [D-125].
  date: 2026-11-13
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-14.8]
