```mdl
decision D-140: An edit sets each value on the parsed document: a value in place, keeping its comment, and a list keeping its style and the items that stay (an item with an `@version` matches its id), with new ones after them. Front matter that is not a readable YAML map reads as unreadable, not as none, and is returned as it is. Fills in [D-139].
