```mdl
decision D-142: An edit sets each value on the parsed document, and the document is written with the YAML 1.2 core schema in YAML 1.1 compatibility, so a value either reader would take for a number, boolean or null is quoted. A value keeps its comment, a single value made a list keeps it too, and a list keeps its style and the first of the items that stay, an item matching an id with or without an `@version`, with new ones after them. Fills in [D-139].
  date: 2026-11-13
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  supersedes: D-140
  affects: [F-14.8]
